BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 258.93 Tm (  beat it, and a better chiller saves less per hour switched off.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 246.05 Tm (- Full-load kW/ton OVERSTATES the draw at the moment free cooling is available, because free cooling) Tj ET
