BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 212.45 Tm (  part-load point free-cooling weather sits at.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 199.57 Tm (- The heat rejected is APPROXIMATED by the IT load. UPS, PDU and lighting losses inside the envelope) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 188.37 Tm (  add to it; some overhead sits outside the cooled space, so scaling by full PUE would overshoot. No) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 177.17 Tm (  PUE multiplier is applied.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 164.29 Tm (- EIA STATE-SECTOR AVERAGES, not the site's tariff. A Loudoun County campus buys on a) Tj ET
